Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.85,0:00:03.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.65,0:00:05.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果恶魔石碑能关上地狱大门\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the demon tablet can shut the gates of hell,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.09,0:00:06.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使石碑会有什么威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}what can the angel tablet do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.22,0:00:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能让你带走它  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't let you take that, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.87,0:00:09.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在只知道要保护这块石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know that I have to protect this tablet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.86,0:00:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-防着娜奥米吗  -还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- From Naomi? - And from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.58,0:00:12.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  你在说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}From me? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:14.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡  见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass! Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我叫娜奥米  -我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My name is Naomi. - Oh, I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:18.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道小卡离开炼狱后你对他做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know what you did to Cass after he got out of purgatory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:20.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥  他们在控制我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're controlling us, Castiel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.36,0:00:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在卡西迪奥不知去向\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now Castiel is in the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:24.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,兜里还揣着个氢弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a hydrogen bomb in his pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.58,0:00:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝建立了一系列测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}God built a series of tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.30,0:00:28.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等你都完成了  就可以去关门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you've done all three, you can slam the gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二道测试是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the second trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:31.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从地狱拯救一个无辜的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}An innocent soul has to be rescued from hell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.64,0:00:33.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并将它送入天堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and delivered unto heaven.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.32,0:00:36.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.30,0:00:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二个测试对你的伤害比第一个要大很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}That second trial hit you a lot harder than that first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.07,0:00:41.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他钻进了我的脑子  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in my head, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.54,0:00:42.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐惧  躲藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear, the hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那样的话  他就知道我的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if he's in my head, he knows where I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.01,0:00:46.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以为你能躲我一辈子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you could elude me forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.89,0:00:48.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.56,0:00:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小毛孩逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little geek made a run for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.69,0:00:51.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  但他会去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but where?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.66,0:00:53.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.32,0:01:33.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文  是我们  开门啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin, come on! It's us! Open up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.66,0:01:36.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等死人啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're bleeding out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.94,0:01:39.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计  是我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.60,0:01:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我湿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's wet me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.49,0:01:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你忘了敲门暗号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You forgot the knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.61,0:01:45.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你不那么敲还制定敲门暗号做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point of a secret knock if you don't use it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.70,0:01:47.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.04,0:01:50.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.71,0:01:57.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拿到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.81,0:02:00.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们得到消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we caught a tip
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.05,0:02:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力在到处活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}that Crowley was moving his earth-side operations,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.21,0:02:05.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,于是我们就设了个套\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we, uh, laid ourselves an awesome trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:06.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也得到了回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.02,0:02:10.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们拿到那一半石碑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got the other half of the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:12.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.37,0:02:14.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,守得云开见月明了  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the light at the end of your tunnel, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.28,0:02:17.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可别说我们没给过你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't say we never got you nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.50,0:02:21.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天呐  真的假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy crap. Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.52,0:02:24.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以解开第三道测试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get the third trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.09,0:02:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于能知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can finally figure out
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.06,0:02:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要如何永远把克劳力关在地狱里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}how to close the gates of hell on Crowley's ass forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.56,0:02:31.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.24,0:02:34.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们去把另一半的石碑找出来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we digging up the other half of that thing or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.79,0:02:36.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.61,0:02:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  机灵鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh special k,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.74,0:02:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你继续埋头研究上帝的石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}you keep your nose to the God-stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.05,0:02:48.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去离这儿很远的地方整出点事端来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna drive out and make a lot of noise a long way from here, 
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.19,0:02:49.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好保证你这里的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep the safeboat safe for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.02,0:02:55.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们尽快回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back as soon as we can, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.56,0:02:59.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他应该没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess he's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.13,0:03:02.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  我们走后锁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Don't forget to lock up after us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.61,0:03:36.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三道测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, it's three trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.03,0:03:40.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三道测试温家兄弟就能把我关起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three trials and the Winchesters get to lock the door on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.47,0:03:47.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  假萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, fake Sam,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.21,0:03:49.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你泄露了我们的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're gonna tip our hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.66,0:03:52.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就只能再一次抹去凯文的短时记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have to scrub Kevin's short-term memory again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:56.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样很危险  所以你注意点那些土话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's risky, so watch the patois in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.71,0:03:57.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patois?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.15,0:03:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,俚语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your slang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.42,0:04:01.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"机灵鬼"  "上帝的石头"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Special k," "Nose to the God-stone" --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.26,0:04:02.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩才那么说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way Dean speaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.24,0:04:06.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆说话更普通  \N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam is...more basic,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.86,0:04:08.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更真诚\N{\fnArial\fs30} more sincere.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:11.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记住  我需要你们模仿得惟妙惟肖 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, I want two distinct, 
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.81,0:04:14.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,各有特点\N{\fnArial\fs30}authentic characterizations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.11,0:04:16.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.63,0:04:23.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:25.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天生就是个导演\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born to direct.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.40,0:04:32.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第8季第21集]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:37.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:38.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go --
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.52,0:04:43.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,约翰·温彻斯特著名的包治百病炖鸡汤\N{\fnArial\fs30}John Winchester's famous cure-all kitchen-sink stew.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.39,0:04:44.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.86,0:04:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我放的辣椒够烧掉你的嘴皮子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough cayenne pepper in there to burn your lips out,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:48.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像爸爸做的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like dad used to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.31,0:04:53.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还要哥哥喂你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to do the whole, uh, airplane thing with the spoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.74,0:04:58.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你多久没吃东西了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time you ate?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.23,0:05:00.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我不...  -好几天了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't - - Days, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.73,0:05:02.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都三天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.97,0:05:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你哪弄来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:10.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么时候开始发烧的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you start throwing off heat waves?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:14.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-来  -行了  迪恩  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here. - Enough! Dean, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.22,0:05:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带血手绢  发烧  站不稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bloody handkerchiefs, the fever, the shaky legs --
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.00,0:05:22.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:24.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not good,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.60,0:05:29.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非我们能再次开始行动  继续第三道测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm not going to be good until we can start moving again,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.10,0:05:30.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不会好\N{\fnArial\fs30}until I can start the third trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,测试  你连开助力车都休想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trial? I wouldn't let you start a moped.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.75,0:05:38.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事我们没有回头路\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're on the rails with this thing, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.05,0:05:39.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能一直走下去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the only way out of it is through it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:41.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  这我懂  你也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I know, and you know how bad
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.72,0:05:44.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有多想把那些混蛋关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to slam the door on all those sons of bitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.38,0:05:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得让我照顾你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to let me take care of you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.61,0:05:51.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得让我帮你恢复体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to let me help you get your strength back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是感冒或者发烧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't a cold or a fever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.09,0:05:59.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是其他什么你能照顾得了的病\N{\fnArial\fs30}or whatever it is you're supposed to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.68,0:06:01.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是测试的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is part of it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.87,0:06:05.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,前两道测试  不只是我做的什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those first two trials -- they're not just things I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.86,0:06:08.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们对我有损害\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-they're doing something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:10.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们在改变我  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're changing me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.77,0:06:26.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(凯文·谭发来新邮件)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.61,0:06:28.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Kevin.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.75,0:06:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于有消息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.09,0:06:36.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.60,0:06:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这段信息是我预先用软件和\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've set up this message with some software
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,远程服务器设置好的  如果我一周内\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a remote server so it'd send itself to you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有重新设定命令  它就会自动发送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I didn't reset it with a command once a week,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:46.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说我这周没有重设命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means I didn't reset it this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:49.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而那只有一种可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And there's only one reason I wouldn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.61,0:06:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你正在看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}which means if you're watching this then I --
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:54.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我肯定是死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then I'm -- I'm dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.28,0:07:01.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死了  你们两个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm dead, you bastards,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.23,0:07:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的  去上帝的  还有去所有人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so screw you, screw God, and everybody in between!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:09.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我肯定是被克劳力发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley must have gotten to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:13.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道  这次我是逃脱不掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the one thing I know is that I won't break this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道我怎么知道  但我就是知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure how I know, but -- but I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.21,0:07:21.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直在上传我的笔记和翻译\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been uploading all my notes and translations.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把链接发给你  这样你就能拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sending you the links so you can get all of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.00,0:07:26.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们得自己想办法破解其余部分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are gonna have to try to figure out the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.76,0:07:37.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这是我该做的  但是我不能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it was my job, but I -- but I couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.81,0:07:43.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.94,0:07:50.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.65,0:08:03.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  我知道你没见过他  基尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I know you haven't seen him, Keel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁都没见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody has.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.39,0:08:06.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  如果你遇见盖思\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, if you talk to Garth,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:08.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让他给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}then just have him call in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:10.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.35,0:08:11.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思还不见踪影吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth still M.I.A.?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.64,0:08:14.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.61,0:08:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那下一位先知呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about the other prophets in line?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.95,0:08:18.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, if Kevin is, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.22,0:08:23.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了  那不是应该出现下一个了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is dead, then won't one of them be activated?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:26.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,完全没动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. No, not a peep.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:32.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们毫无线索  没有石碑 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are -- no lead, no tablet, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.65,0:08:33.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屁都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:38.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还有这些啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, we got all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:42.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该把他带来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should have moved him here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.15,0:08:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(新墨西哥  圣达菲)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.14,0:09:01.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我渐渐喜欢上这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I've been acquiring the taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.20,0:09:03.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吧  这咖啡还不差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? The coffee's not too bad here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.32,0:09:08.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还记得最初发现咖啡的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I remember when you first discovered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.03,0:09:12.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始煮咖啡之前  还只是嚼咖啡豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you started brewing it, you'd just chew the berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.83,0:09:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.83,0:09:15.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,传说是真的  这的确是跟山羊学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folktale is true, by the way. You learned it from the goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.52,0:09:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在路上走了很久吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, been on the road a long time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.84,0:09:24.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,感觉好像一直都在逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feels like I've been on the run forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:29.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I'm sorry, mister,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.32,0:09:31.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得点一些咖啡之外的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you're gonna have to order more than coffee
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.25,0:09:32.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才能继续坐在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you want to keep the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:35.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, of course. Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.66,0:09:40.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要一份有益心脏的酒糟天麸罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have the smart-heart beer-battered tempura tempters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题  就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. Coming right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.08,0:09:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们靠近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.92,0:09:53.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that, chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.27,0:10:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓  兰斯  那家伙就那么消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear to God, Lance, the guy just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.30,0:10:12.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又吸可卡因了吗  佩里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You on the crack again, Perry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.80,0:10:18.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾昂  告诉我你有好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ion, tell me that you have good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.52,0:10:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的计谋很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's using a clever tactic.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.60,0:10:23.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他利用一家叫比格森的连锁店\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a restaurant called Biggerson's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.01,0:10:26.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.56,0:10:28.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类建了几百家  几乎是完全相同的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The humans have built hundreds of them, almost exactly alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:29.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.28,0:10:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的一致性\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's their sameness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.91,0:10:32.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:34.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西迪奥利用它来反侦查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Castiel is using it against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:35.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.75,0:10:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们试着定位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we try to orient ourselves,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:38.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但那感觉就像我们同时出现在每一个比格森餐厅\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's as if we're in every Biggerson's at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.64,0:10:39.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:39.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被困在了量子叠加之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}trapped in a quantum superposition,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.51,0:10:41.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.53,0:10:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他能决定接下来去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}now, he chooses which to go to next --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.20,0:10:44.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他占了先机\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what's giving him the edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.73,0:10:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是说你抓不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying that you can't catch him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.03,0:10:51.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,实在有太多比格森餐厅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There -- there is just so many Biggerson's.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.97,0:10:53.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.87,0:10:56.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然你说你不能抓到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say he can't be caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.23,0:11:03.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就只能让他别跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we will simply have to make him stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.32,0:11:13.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又出现了  哪里都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}There it is again, every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.99,0:11:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个符号  我见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}This symbol -- I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.06,0:11:20.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文认为这是一种签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Kevin has it down as -- as sort of like a signature
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:22.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝的书记员的签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the scribe of God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.22,0:11:24.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次梅塔特隆做\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears every time Metatron makes one of his,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.76,0:11:26.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,编辑笔记时都有\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, like editor's notes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:27.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.75,0:11:29.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我觉得我见过它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think I've seen it before.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.91,0:11:31.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是很久之前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.06,0:11:34.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我在斯坦福上人文课时见到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was one of my, uh, humanities courses at Stanford.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,斯坦福还教神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}They taught word of God at Stanford?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.75,0:11:44.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  是美国原住民艺术概览\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, uh...it was an overview of native American art.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:45.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像是岩石画\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's a petroglyph.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.75,0:11:47.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,岩什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A petro-what, now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.43,0:11:50.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一符号源自科罗拉多一个小部落\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one belonged to a tiny tribe in Colorado,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.77,0:11:51.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该说是一个宗族\N{\fnArial\fs30}more of a-a clan, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.93,0:11:55.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里面说他们坚守了自己的片山头\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says here they held onto their scrap of mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.53,0:11:56.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而其他部落则败在白人手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}when all the other tribes fell to the white man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.91,0:12:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个字符是一个地域标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, so this glyph was a territorial marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.10,0:12:03.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最接近的翻译为"上帝的使者"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Closest translation -- "Messenger of God."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:11.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"上帝的使者"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Messenger of God."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:15.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"上帝的使者"  迪恩  我们得去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Messenger of God." Dean, we have to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.29,0:12:17.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就凭一个直觉  你几乎没法行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}On that hunch? You can barely function.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.91,0:12:19.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的情况只会更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm only gonna get worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.71,0:12:21.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到我能继续做我该做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, until I get back to the real job,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.30,0:12:23.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到我们弄明白第三道测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we find the third trial -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要个先知啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're out of prophets!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.91,0:12:26.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文都弄不明白的我们也别想\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna figure out what Kevin couldn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.75,0:12:28.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们该去找这个上帝的使者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I say we go to this messenger of God
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:30.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟是这就是他写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}who wrote it in the first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.59,0:12:32.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你觉得这个梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you think that this Metatron
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.27,0:12:36.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟一群印第安人藏在深山老林里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}is hiding out in the mountains with a bunch of indians?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.19,0:12:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:43.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你不该说印第安人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not -- you're not really supposed to say "Indians."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:46.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是...我们该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's... we should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.11,0:12:50.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真有病\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are delirious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.64,0:12:51.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(缅因州  班戈)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(内布拉斯加州  林肯)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.62,0:12:53.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(内华达  里诺)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.69,0:12:54.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(亚利桑那州  图森)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.78,0:12:56.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(新墨西哥州  圣达非)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.10,0:13:05.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.15,0:13:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说你得停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said you have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.26,0:13:10.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.79,0:13:14.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们说你得停下  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They said you have to stop. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.86,0:13:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.91,0:13:23.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.59,0:13:25.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.72,0:13:27.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.43,0:13:30.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们说你得停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said you have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.93,0:13:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.44,0:13:46.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(科罗拉多州  34号公路)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:53.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.93,0:14:12.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.93,0:14:15.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们想要开间房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we'd like a room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:22.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住这里  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.98,0:14:41.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.42,0:14:44.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听到什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hear what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.87,0:14:50.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他得了流感\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has the flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.75,0:14:58.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.37,0:15:02.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得停下  他们说你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop. They said you --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.58,0:15:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都听不清自己在想什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't hear myself think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:11.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本应照顾他们  而不是谋杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to be their shepherds, not their murderers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.40,0:15:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,并不总是如此  天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not always, angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.85,0:15:18.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不久之前在埃及\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was that day back in Egypt not so long ago
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.02,0:15:21.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们杀死了每一个头胎婴儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we slew every firstborn infant
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.99,0:15:24.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们的门上没有撒上羊羔血\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose door wasn't splashed with lamb's blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.83,0:15:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那只是公关\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that was just P.R.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.37,0:15:29.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:33.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you were there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.95,0:15:35.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只是不记得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just don't remember it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}How -- how many times
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.37,0:15:43.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你钻进我的脑袋  给我彻底洗脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you torn into my head and washed it clean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:47.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坦白说  太多太多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, too damn many.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.91,0:15:55.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是著名的捣蛋鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the famous spanner in the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.17,0:15:59.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实说  我觉得你下线的时候就没造好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, I think you came off the line with a crack in your chassis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:02.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你从不按吩咐做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have never done what you were told,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.35,0:16:04.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总要自我发挥一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}not completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.93,0:16:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你连死都死不好  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't even die right, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.63,0:16:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天使之碑在哪  卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the angel tablet, Castiel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:16.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用我一个好朋友的话来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the words of a... good friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.48,0:16:19.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咬我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}bite me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:23.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we'll bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.25,0:16:25.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去  搜遍每个比格森\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Search all these...Biggerson's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.23,0:16:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定在这一路上藏了起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must have hidden it along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.24,0:16:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看字都困难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can barely see.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.65,0:16:53.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need food.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.77,0:17:00.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  烤肋排  土豆泥\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Uh, barbecue ribs, mashed potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.46,0:17:02.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒜味土豆泥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garlic mashed potatoeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:05.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蒜味土豆泥  有生菜幼叶的凉拌蔬菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garlic mashed potatoes, mixed greens with baby lettuce,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.88,0:17:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玉米面包  还有泰式炒河粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}cornbread, and, uh, Pad Thai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.27,0:17:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,盖思说小镇另一边有一个很不错的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Garth says there's a good little place on the other side of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.46,0:17:18.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管他呢  这孩子一直很努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? Kid's been working hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.21,0:17:29.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些人还挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those guys aren't half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.98,0:17:32.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  您很有眼光\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. You chose well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.95,0:17:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  要不是我得统筹全局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, if I wasn't running everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.28,0:17:36.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就自己上阵扮迪恩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have played Dean myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.99,0:17:39.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,您扮迪恩一定很像  先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you would have made a great Dean, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:52.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里就是一般的旅游圣地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Regular tourist mecca we got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.06,0:17:55.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是这里唯一的客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the only guests in this whole place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.65,0:17:57.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上一次登记入住时间是06年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last entry in the registry was in '06.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.43,0:18:02.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你记得那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you remember when, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.22,0:18:05.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸带我俩坐骡车去\N{\fnArial\fs30}when dad took us to the bottom of the Grand Canyon on that 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.43,0:18:06.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大峡谷谷底吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}pack-mule ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.05,0:18:07.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.74,0:18:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your, uh -- 
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.40,0:18:12.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的骡子一直在放屁\N{\fnArial\fs30}your mule kept farting,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一刻不定  像刮大风一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just letting go,  like gale force.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老弟  你那时才四岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, you were like four years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.65,0:18:21.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都不怎么记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I barely remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.08,0:18:26.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你骑着屁屁驴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You rode a farty donkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.38,0:18:29.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我去查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, uh, I'm gonna go check out
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.74,0:18:32.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两河旅游博物馆和贸易站\N{\fnArial\fs30}the two Rivers travel museum and trading post.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:33.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要...我要...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna -- I'm gonna, um --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟踪旅馆经理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna follow the hotel manager,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.44,0:18:40.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愁容博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}D-Dr. Scowley-scowl.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.37,0:18:42.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就像是《史酷比》里的反派角色\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's like a villain from "Scooby-doo."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.96,0:18:44.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  小大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, hey, uh, little big man,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.56,0:18:47.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该好好休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}you should get some rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  这样也行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can do that, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.52,0:18:55.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两河部落的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people of the two rivers tribe
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.40,0:18:57.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几世纪之前来到这片土地\N{\fnArial\fs30}came to this land centuries ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.96,0:18:59.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里艰苦多石\N{\fnArial\fs30}a land that was harsh and stony.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.45,0:19:02.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是他们强大的领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}But their mighty leader
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.97,0:19:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,告诉他的人民他们必须留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}told his people that they must stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:07.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他声称  这是大神神圣的信使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He claimed that this was the home on earth
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.59,0:19:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在地球的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the Great Spirits' sacred messenger
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.96,0:19:11.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他们能提供贡品\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that if they'd made offerings,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.62,0:19:12.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就会受到恩泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their blessings would be many.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.30,0:19:15.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的贡品是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were the offerings? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.73,0:19:19.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大神神圣的信使要了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what did the Great Spirit'' sacred messenger ask for?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.08,0:19:20.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.41,0:19:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让人们给他讲故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked the people to tell him stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:33.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道恩泽是什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet I know what the blessings were.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:20:59.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.53,0:21:06.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到处都找了  不在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been all over them. It's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.36,0:21:10.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.11,0:21:12.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.12,0:21:16.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们把石碑放回它该在的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us put the tablet back where it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.80,0:21:20.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得保护它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to protect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.54,0:21:21.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不让天使拿到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the angels?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.37,0:21:24.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不让任何人拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}From all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.26,0:21:31.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不见棺材不掉泪了  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just going to have to pull you apart, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.94,0:21:45.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娜奥米  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:49.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想我了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.14,0:22:04.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-走开  见鬼  -别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get off! What the hell?! - Take it easy, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.25,0:22:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.13,0:22:08.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别紧张  别紧...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Take it --
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.06,0:22:12.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发现你躺在地板上  昏了过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found you on the floor, passed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.52,0:22:13.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的体温都41.7度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your temperature was 107.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.86,0:22:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我必须得让你退烧  否则你就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to force it down or you were toast.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.40,0:22:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他在这里  迪恩  梅塔特隆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here, Dean. The Metatron is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.95,0:22:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  我能听到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it. I can hear him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.95,0:22:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.71,0:22:26.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道  不知为什么我和它相通\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I know is that I'm connected to it somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.03,0:22:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么  你和它有联系  像先知那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, like you got a link to him, like a prophet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.01,0:22:30.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.23,0:22:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只知道他在这里  梅塔特隆在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know he's here. The Metatron is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.15,0:22:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  这里哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Here where?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.69,0:22:38.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能指给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能指给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can show you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.21,0:22:43.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个经理  他在给他寄书\N{\fnArial\fs30}The manager -- he was delivering books to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.31,0:22:45.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-书吗  -书\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Books? - Books.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.81,0:22:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,精装的  平装本  小说  书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard-covers, paperbacks, novels -- books.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.04,0:22:51.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stories.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.43,0:22:55.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.61,0:22:59.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让我研发部的人融了一把天使之刃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had my R&D people melt down one of your angel blades,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.31,0:23:02.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,制成子弹  似乎效果不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}cast it into bullets. Seems to do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.53,0:23:04.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好大胆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}How dare you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.89,0:23:08.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你遇见的最大胆的恶魔  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am the daringest devil you've ever met, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.44,0:23:15.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之前也这样交过手  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been here before, haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.12,0:23:18.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看谁先眨眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see who blinks first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.10,0:23:37.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.04,0:23:42.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.09,0:23:45.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我收买了一个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got me an angel on the payroll.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.45,0:23:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,近来世界就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that kind of universe these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.41,0:24:03.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带上他跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now grab him and follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.58,0:24:06.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, kid, you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.18,0:24:08.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.38,0:24:10.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石头中的裂缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the break in the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.49,0:24:12.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有重要信息  我解不出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's key writing. I-I can't make it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.76,0:24:15.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.83,0:24:18.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的确需要另一半石碑才能破译\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I do need the other half of the tablet to get the trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.70,0:24:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它离这里不远\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not too far from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.05,0:24:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好极了  石碑在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Awesome. Uh, well, what's the 10-20?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.51,0:24:32.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只想暂时放下主要行动  偷个闲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wanted to take a moment away from the main action...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.00,0:24:40.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和我的老生意伙伴聊聊天\N{\fnArial\fs30}...to chat with my old business partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.20,0:24:43.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想你暂时还不会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assume you won't die just yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.87,0:24:45.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内脏出血  很久很痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes a painful long time to bleed out from the gut.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.60,0:24:49.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,克劳力  你想做什么就做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do whatever you want, Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.36,0:24:53.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不会告诉你我把石碑埋在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will never tell you where I buried the tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.01,0:24:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Cass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.52,0:24:57.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.75,0:24:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luckily...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.06,0:25:02.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你不用告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.50,0:25:04.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我这位身价昂贵的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been getting regular updates
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.00,0:25:07.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会定期告诉我新的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}from my expensive friend here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.98,0:25:10.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,娜奥米应该一开始就抓住你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Naomi should have caught you out of the gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.95,0:25:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟最近她一直在你的脑袋里面转悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}seeing as lately she's been knuckles deep in that melon of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.47,0:25:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她认为你碰到了石碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}She thinks that your touching the tablet
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.66,0:25:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打破了她的咒语  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}has broken her spell over you. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.83,0:25:24.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石碑本就不该被天使拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tablets weren't meant for the angels,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.80,0:25:27.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they weren't meant for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.71,0:25:29.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她有太多的事要处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got a lot on her plate,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.87,0:25:32.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不怪不得没想到这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can't fault her for missing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.33,0:25:35.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自思自忖  "我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was thinking to myself, "Self,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.63,0:25:39.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果小卡摸了石碑就能摆脱她\N{\fnArial\fs30}"If Cass got away from her by touching the tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.90,0:25:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么他不一直摸着石碑呢"\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would he ever stop touching the tablet?"
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.02,0:25:45.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后我又想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I thought to myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.29,0:25:51.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"我啊  他就是一直都摸着石碑  对吗"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Self...he hasn't stopped touching the tablet, now, has he?"
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.95,0:26:20.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真好  真好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you're a pip, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.60,0:26:25.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.19,0:26:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是王\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the King.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.67,0:26:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子告诉我们另一半在哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid told us where the other half was,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.58,0:26:37.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但并不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it...wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.78,0:26:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该死的耍我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dab of crap tricked us,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.92,0:26:44.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把我们送进了猎人陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}sent us into some kind of hunter mousetrap.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.10,0:26:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠢货  你们这是在拖我后腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jackasses. You're ruining my streak!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.04,0:26:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看好他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.89,0:26:54.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.15,0:26:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我应该带你去急诊室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be taking you to the E.R.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.80,0:27:00.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们什么都帮不了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't do anything for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.28,0:27:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗  我开始回忆起一些事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've been remembering things --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.92,0:27:06.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是琐事  记得很清\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little things so clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.52,0:27:07.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  骑驴吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Donkey rides?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.71,0:27:10.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾读书给我听  在我还小\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used to read to me, um, when I was little --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.57,0:27:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的很小的时候  读那本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I mean really little, from -- from that old, uh
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.97,0:27:15.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《经典名著漫画》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Classics illustrated" Comic book.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.55,0:27:17.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你记得吗  -不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You remember that? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.00,0:27:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,, 《圆桌骑士》\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Knights of the round table."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.66,0:27:21.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亚瑟王所有的骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had all of King Arthur's knights,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.22,0:27:23.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们都在设法取得圣杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they were all on the quest for the Holy Grail.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.01,0:27:25.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得看到一幅加拉哈德骑士的图\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember looking at this picture of Sir Galahad,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.66,0:27:27.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跪着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and -- and -- and he was kneeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.64,0:27:31.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一束光照在他脸上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and -- and light streaming over his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.32,0:27:36.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我记得  我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I remember... thinking, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.36,0:27:40.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我绝对不可能像那样去追寻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could never go on a quest like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.99,0:27:46.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我不纯净\N{\fnArial\fs30}...because I'm not clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.23,0:27:51.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还只是个小孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I-I was just a little kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.07,0:27:58.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我早就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think maybe I knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.28,0:28:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在内心深处\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, deep down, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.42,0:28:06.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道我体内有恶魔的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had... demon blood in me
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.88,0:28:10.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很邪恶  所以我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and about the evil of it and that I...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.87,0:28:14.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不纯净\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't pure?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.80,0:28:17.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  那不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, it's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.20,0:28:19.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在这不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.80,0:28:22.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为这些测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}because these trials...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.79,0:28:27.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们在净化我\N{\fnArial\fs30}...they're purifying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.78,0:28:41.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们之前在这里  那些书  那些盒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were here, the -- the -- the books, the boxes!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.06,0:28:43.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They -- they're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.29,0:29:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.23,0:29:32.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.13,0:29:36.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是梅塔特隆  这是梅塔特隆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Metatron? This is Metatron?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.43,0:29:38.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.62,0:29:52.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁派你们来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.20,0:29:54.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们自己来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came on our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.78,0:29:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.64,0:29:59.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是迪恩  他是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean. This is Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.80,0:30:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是米迦勒的手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You work for Michael?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.92,0:30:03.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.13,0:30:07.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么  难道你没听说过我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you really haven't heard of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.38,0:30:10.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你算是个什么天使啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of angel are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.82,0:30:13.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是温家双煞\N{\fnArial\fs30}W-we're the freaking Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.15,0:30:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到什么时候算是个头\N{\fnArial\fs30}How -- how far can this go?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.31,0:30:25.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh. Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.30,0:30:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ion...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.79,0:30:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要放任到什么地步\N{\fnArial\fs30}How far can we let it all drop?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.58,0:30:34.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个重担是留给我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This charge was left to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.98,0:30:36.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我们的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's our mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.21,0:30:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的知道我们的使命吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know what the mission was?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.40,0:30:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的脑子都被他们侵入过\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've been in all our heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.10,0:30:52.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可不是机器  任由他们摆布\N{\fnArial\fs30}We aren't machines for them to program and reprogram.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.42,0:30:54.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不该是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't what this was meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.81,0:30:57.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,管他呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.85,0:31:01.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你大错特错  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so wrong, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.60,0:31:08.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It all matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.50,0:31:29.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小屁孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You little prat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.77,0:31:33.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩得爽吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You having fun yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.66,0:31:37.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.92,0:31:40.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没看错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I seeing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.89,0:31:44.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you figure it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.36,0:31:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们忘了敲门暗号时我就发现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It started when they forgot the secret knock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.76,0:31:50.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但真正让我确定的是他们的举止\N{\fnArial\fs30}But really, it -- it was the way they acted.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.32,0:31:53.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算在兴头上  萨姆和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think on their best day Sam and Dean
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.02,0:31:55.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不会跑到镇上给我买烤肉吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}would go into town and get me a barbecue dinner,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.82,0:31:58.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,况且冰箱里还有剩的墨西哥卷呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}n-not when there are leftover burritos in the fridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.82,0:32:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.88,0:32:05.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我家的小鬼们还太有礼貌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Demons were too polite?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.59,0:32:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.79,0:32:11.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll be a son of a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.48,0:32:14.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,米迦勒和路西法...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael and Lucifer --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.65,0:32:17.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几个家伙都已经下油锅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-those -- those dudes are in the deep fryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.11,0:32:19.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  是被我们丢进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We put them there ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.53,0:32:23.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那加百列和拉斐尔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Gabriel and Raphael?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.71,0:32:24.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.99,0:32:26.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是真不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't know this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.48,0:32:29.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直很小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been very careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.44,0:32:30.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  你能...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can you --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.31,0:32:33.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能把它关掉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you turn that down?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.25,0:32:34.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关掉什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn what down?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.98,0:32:40.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在共鸣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're resonating.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.93,0:32:42.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,共鸣  什么意思  什么叫共鸣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Resonating? What -- what do you mean, resonating?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.47,0:32:45.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你正在接受测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've undertaken the trials.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.52,0:32:49.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在做测试呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trying to pull one of the great levers, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.51,0:32:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你做了不少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pretty far along, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.00,0:32:56.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走到这一步  就会开始与圣语共鸣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get that far along, you start resonating with the word
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.99,0:32:59.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者与其物质层面上的源头共鸣\N{\fnArial\fs30}or with its source on the material plane --
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.15,0:33:02.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.22,0:33:05.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你很小心  怎么个小心法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were being careful. Careful how?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.88,0:33:07.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟他们不是一类\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.69,0:33:09.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是大天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not an archangel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.61,0:33:11.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是个普通天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really more run-of-the-mill.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.12,0:33:14.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在上帝选我记录神之语前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I worked in the secretarial pool
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.10,0:33:16.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是个小秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}before god chose me to take down the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.93,0:33:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正他对他的工作非常忧虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, he seemed very worried about his work,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.55,0:33:24.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,担心他离开之后心血不保\N{\fnArial\fs30}what would happen to it when he left,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.07,0:33:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以他让我记录下指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he had me write down instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.82,0:33:31.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.96,0:33:35.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此后...\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.57,0:33:39.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大天使们接管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archangels took over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.12,0:33:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们哭天喊地\N{\fnArial\fs30}They cried, and they wailed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.91,0:33:48.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只想要天父回来  我们都想\N{\fnArial\fs30}They wanted their father back. I mean, we all did.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.53,0:33:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但后来呢  他们开始密谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then -- then they started to scheme.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.03,0:33:57.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大天使们认为  既然他们成了没爹的苦孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The archangels decided if they couldn't have dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.16,0:34:00.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就自己掌管整个宇宙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd take over the universe themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.59,0:34:04.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是没了神之语\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they couldn't do anything that big
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.36,0:34:05.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们成不了如此大业\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the word of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.23,0:34:09.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我慢慢意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I began to realize
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.65,0:34:13.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们有天可能会发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe they would realize...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.84,0:34:16.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们需要我\N{\fnArial\fs30}they needed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.90,0:34:21.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以你为此很担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you get a ruffle in your feathers
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.14,0:34:22.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,决定从此躲起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and just decide to disappear,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.38,0:34:25.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打算一辈子把头埋在沙子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}go stick your head in the sand forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.39,0:34:29.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道外面世界都发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what's been going on out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.42,0:34:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.69,0:34:35.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这么打算的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the whole point.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.34,0:34:38.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这些下面的卫戍兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}You soldiers down in the garrison --
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.25,0:34:40.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少他们让你相信了谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least they let you believe the lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.36,0:34:44.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上面的  为娜奥米干活儿  秘密行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Upstairs, working for Naomi, working in intelligence,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.67,0:34:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别无选择  只能活在肮脏之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}we had no option but to live in the dirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.23,0:34:51.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她从未对我进行完全重启  我知道的太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never reset me completely. I always knew too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.44,0:34:54.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得完成我的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to -- I had to do my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.45,0:34:55.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,艾昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ion...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.70,0:34:57.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.29,0:35:11.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你一直窝在这里  或者是个小木屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you have been holed up here or -- or -- or in a wigwam
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.03,0:35:13.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者在什么洞里\N{\fnArial\fs30}or before that, in some cave,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.65,0:35:15.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听故事  读小说\N{\fnArial\fs30}listening to stories, reading books?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.98,0:35:19.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大有看头哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was something to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.88,0:35:23.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们人类带到祂的世界中的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you brought to his earth --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.34,0:35:27.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些重罪  谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the mayhem, the murder,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.51,0:35:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝的人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}just the raw, 
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.54,0:35:34.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们原始而狂野的创造\N{\fnArial\fs30}wild invention of god's naked apes --
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.28,0:35:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真让人大开眼界\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was mind-blowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.34,0:35:41.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但说实在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But really, really...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.11,0:35:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真正有趣的是你们所讲的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was your storytelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.76,0:35:49.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是真正的自由意志之花\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the true flower of free will,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.66,0:35:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少是你们目前能掌握的自由意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}at least as you've mastered it so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.40,0:35:58.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你们创造故事时  你们就是上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you create stories, you become gods
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.82,0:36:03.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然是在你们自己一个微小复杂的范围内\N{\fnArial\fs30}of tiny, intricate dimensions unto themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.05,0:36:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一花一世界啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.85,0:36:08.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我读过...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have read...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.07,0:36:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经尽一个天使所能去读了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...as much as it's possible for an angel to read,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.01,0:36:14.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而我还是没能全部读完\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I haven't caught up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.81,0:36:16.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.51,0:36:21.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开枪吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull the freaking trigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.17,0:36:24.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.82,0:36:26.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-开枪吧  -萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pull the freaking trigger... - Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.93,0:36:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这个胆小的垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}you cowardly piece of garbage.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.81,0:36:31.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么长时间  你一直躲在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the time you've been hiding here,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.52,0:36:33.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你读到了多少苦难\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much suffering have you read over?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.14,0:36:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类在受苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Humanity's suffering.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.09,0:36:38.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又有多少是出自你们族类之手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how much of it has been at the hands of your kind?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.97,0:36:43.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要听故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want a story?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.76,0:36:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文·谭的故事怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try Kevin Tran's story. 
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.18,0:36:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was just a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.50,0:36:49.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个成绩优异的好孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a good, straight-"A" kid,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.88,0:36:53.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后他被卷进了这些天使的鬼事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he got sucked in to all of this -- this angel crap
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.74,0:36:58.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成了神之语的先知  你的先知\N{\fnArial\fs30}and became a prophet of the word of god -- your prophet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.71,0:37:01.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你应该照应他的  但你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you should have been looking out for him, but no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.61,0:37:04.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里龟缩着  读书 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead, you're here, holed up, reading books.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.65,0:37:11.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他死了  就因为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead now because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.50,0:37:18.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道温彻斯特兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the Winchesters 
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.47,0:37:19.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备进行第三项测试了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}are up to the third trial?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.83,0:37:23.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们打算关掉地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know they're gonna shut the door on hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.68,0:37:26.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一点也不担心  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not worried, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.59,0:37:33.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不知道恶魔石碑上写了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what's on this demon tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.24,0:37:37.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及能从这上获取的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the power you could have gotten with this
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.23,0:37:40.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你没像被砍了头的小鸡一样乱跑的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you weren't running around like a chicken with his head cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.61,0:37:42.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我是来逼你开口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I can't make you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.83,0:37:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你办不到  虽然你想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you can't, and you do, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.56,0:37:50.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.40,0:37:52.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've already won.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.42,0:37:58.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有天使石碑  小混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have the angel tablet, you little smudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.85,0:38:03.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经有了计划安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I got deals and plans up the jacksie.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.92,0:38:05.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't... 
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.38,0:38:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要...你\N{\fnArial\fs30}need...you!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.46,0:38:54.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.10,0:38:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he good?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.15,0:38:58.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给他点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give him a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.35,0:39:10.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么通过克劳力的天使防卫咒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get past Crowley's angel warding?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.36,0:39:14.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是神的书记员  我把咒语抹去了 \N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the scribe of god. I erased it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.62,0:39:16.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你看见了  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you saw, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.57,0:39:19.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在知道都发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you -- you're caught up on everything that's been going on,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.87,0:39:24.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么久以来你的同胞对人类做的各种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the crap that your brethren's been doing to humanity all this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.70,0:39:26.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我救了这个男孩  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved the boy, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.19,0:39:30.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你要加入我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But are you in? With us, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.84,0:39:34.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的想关闭地狱之门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really intend on closing the doors of hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.17,0:39:39.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该这么做  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems like the thing to do, don't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.94,0:39:42.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.30,0:39:45.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,归根结底都是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what this has all been about --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.67,0:39:47.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们人类的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}the choices your kind make.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.74,0:39:52.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得权衡这个选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're gonna have to weigh that choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.80,0:39:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,问问你自己"这么做的代价是什么"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask yourself, "What is it going to take to do this,"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.00,0:39:59.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以及"完成后世界会变成什么样"\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, "What will the world be like after it's done?"
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.33,0:40:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.86,0:40:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.63,0:40:12.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,凯文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kevin?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.84,0:40:20.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们以为失去你了呢  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought we lost you, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.40,0:40:23.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.99,0:40:28.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,石碑的另一半  我拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second half of the tablet, and I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.25,0:40:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第三项测试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Third trial.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.32,0:40:35.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没告诉克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't tell Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.61,0:40:39.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.22,0:40:41.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,治愈一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}To cure a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.34,0:40:49.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.62,0:40:53.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.00,0:41:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,治愈一个恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cure a demon?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.99,0:41:04.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  先不说我完全不明白那是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, ignoring the fact that I have no idea what that actually means,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.87,0:41:07.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们这么做  你会好起来的  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we -- if we do this, you get better, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.11,0:41:09.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不会再咳嗽得像是要把肺咳出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you'll stop trying to cough up a lung
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.76,0:41:11.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不会撞上家具了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and -- and -- and bumping into furniture?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.37,0:41:14.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感觉好多了  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel better, yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.93,0:41:17.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有了前进的方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, just having a direction to move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.71,0:41:19.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, good,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.84,0:41:21.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们要做的事貌似不简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause where we're headed doesn't sound like a picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.33,0:41:24.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们有目标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're heading somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.64,0:41:27.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向结局前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.99,0:41:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass?!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.47,0:41:44.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来帮帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little help here.
